        <info>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;During this Stage, identify the prospects needs, which products may be appropriate, who the stakeholders are and ensure the prospect is worth going after.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;Add &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;Products&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt; to Opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Add Number of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Payers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;at Opportunit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;y.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</info>
